{"sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","items":[{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k001","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소는 활성화 자유에너지를 낮춰 반응속도를 높이지만 평형상수나 반응의 표준 자유에너지 변화를 바꾸지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k002","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"활성부위는 기질의 결합 및 전이상태 안정화에 적합하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k003","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"보조인자에는 금속 이온과 유기 보조효소가 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k004","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"E+S⇌ES→E+P의 단순 모형에서 초기속도, 정상상태 근사를 적용하면 미카엘리스–멘텐 식을 얻는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k005","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"[S]≪Km이면 v≈(Vmax/Km)[S], [S]≫Km이면 v≈Vmax다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k006","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"kcat은 포화기질에서 효소 활성자리당 단위시간 회전수, kcat/Km은 낮은 기질 농도에서 촉매 효율의 지표이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k007","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"이중역수 그래프는 기울기 Km/Vmax, y절편 1/Vmax, x절편 -1/Km을 갖는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k008","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"[S]=Km이면 v=Vmax/2.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k009","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소 농도 증가 시 Vmax 증가, 이상적 단순계에서 Km 불변.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k010","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"효소는 정·역반응을 모두 촉진한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"enzyme--kinetics-k011","sectionId":"enzyme/kinetics","unitId":"enzyme","subject":"biology","text":"75이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}